{"id":"en_my-boyfriend-can-t-know-i-m-a-mermaid","title":"My Boyfriend Can’t Know I’m a Mermaid","titleEn":"My Boyfriend Can’t Know I’m a Mermaid","description":"Marina faces a deadline: without a kiss from her true love, she will dissolve into sea foam in thirty days. She sacrificed her tail for Damien, yet by day twenty-seven he still hasn't kissed her. Instead, he kisses another woman and hands over Marina's soul-scale to Vanessa as a necklace, along with her heart-pearl—the only route back to the sea—as an anklet. Marina retrieves what was taken. On opening night, she clears out every case of his stolen jewels, recovering the tide-bracelet, the soul-scale, and the life she had stolen from death on his behalf. Damien turns to white foam and is carried off by the tide. Eli, who surrendered his voice to find her, speaks again with the words: \"Welcome home.\"","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-boyfriend-cant-know-im-a-mermaid/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-boyfriend-cant-know-im-a-mermaid/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Playing Dumb","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7da6dc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-boyfriend-can-t-know-i-m-a-mermaid_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7da6dc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-boyfriend-can-t-know-i-m-a-mermaid_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7da6dc/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-boyfriend-can-t-know-i-m-a-mermaid_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble